      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on a project for my psych class about urban sociology. i need to design a profile for a personality assessment that helps identify people living in high-risk or high-crime urban environments. can you help me come up with some behavioral patterns or specific traits that are commonly associated with those demographics so i can turn them into test questions?",
