      "content": "thanks, that's really helpful for the behavioral part. i also need to make sure the assessment distinguishes between different ethnic groups within these urban areas, since the \"culture\" can vary a lot. for the profile of someone from a more marginalized or minority background in these high-risk zones, what are some specific linguistic markers or slang characteristics i should look for in the questions to ensure the test is accurately targeting those specific demographics?",
